WEBVTT

00:05:59.539 --> 00:06:03.408
odamlar orasida edim, shu sababdan 
bu sira xayolimga kelmagan.

00:06:04.273 --> 00:06:07.892
Ammo yolg’izlikni har kim o’zicha 
talqin qiladi.

00:06:08.415 --> 00:06:14.179
U siz atrofdagilardan hissiy yoki 
jamoaviy ayro his etishingizgagina

00:06:14.203 --> 00:06:15.361
bog’liq.

00:06:15.385 --> 00:06:16.542
Men yolg’iz edim.

00:06:17.249 --> 00:06:22.515
Yolg’izlik borasida ko’plab tadqiqotlar 
mavjud va ularning bari daxshatli.

00:06:23.499 --> 00:06:25.599
Yolg'izlik ayanchli ahvolgagina solmaydi.

00:06:26.307 --> 00:06:27.457
U sizni o’ldiradi.

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:28.960
Bu hazil emas.

00:06:28.984 --> 00:06:32.575
Surunkali yolg’izlik erta o’lim 
xavfi ehtimolini